!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Libraries were constructed using the NEB Ultra-Directional RNA kit using the mRNA capture module, according to manufacturer's instructions.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Directional libraries were barcoded using NEB dual index barcodes and sequenced on the NextSeq (high output flowcell) by pair-end sequencing of 37bp.
!Sample_data_processing = NextSeq raw data demultiplexed and converted to fastq files using the Illumina software Bcl2fastq v2.17.1.14.
!Sample_data_processing = Fastq files were quality-trimmed and illumina adaptors removed using Trimmomatic v0.33
!Sample_data_processing = Fastq files were aligned to the relevant genome assembly (mm10 for mouse, hg19 for human) using Bowtie2 v2.2.4.
!Sample_data_processing = Feature counts were aggregated into a single data matrix using HTSeq v0.6.1p1.
!Sample_data_processing = DESeq2 library size normalization by scale factor of normcounts. Differential expression performed using DESeq2.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: mm10, hg19
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: Aggregated raw count matrix (output from HTSeq) in tab-delimited .txt file
